          "text": "On a single 80-gigabyte A100 GPU, MeZO can train a 30-billion-parameter model, where backpropagation with Adam fits only a 2.7-billion one. Across many tasks and model scales, MeZO matches fine-tuning performance with up to twelve times less memory.",
