          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_second_through_comprehensive_experim",
          "text": "Second, through comprehensive experiments across masked and autoregressive models, scales up to sixty-six billion parameters, and classification, multiple-choice, and generation tasks, it shows MeZO matches full backpropagation fine-tuning while using far less memory.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "second",
            "through",
            "comprehensive",
            "experiments",
            "across",
            "masked",
            "autoregressive",
            "models",
            "scales",
            "sixty-six"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_third_demonstrates_compatibility_par",
          "text": "Third, it demonstrates compatibility with parameter-efficient methods like LoRA and prefix tuning, and the ability to optimize non-differentiable objectives such as accuracy or F1.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "third",
            "demonstrates",
            "compatibility",
